<section id="faq" class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-white">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-8 max-w-4xl">
    <div class="text-center mb-16" data-animate>
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[#2a9d8f] font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
        <span class="w-8 h-0.5 bg-[#2a9d8f]"></span>Questions fréquentes<span class="w-8 h-0.5 bg-[#2a9d8f]"></span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-black text-[#1a3a6b] mb-4" style="font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif">Foire aux Questions</h2>
      <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-[#f4a020] rounded-full mx-auto mb-6"></div>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
        Vous avez des questions sur nos services ? Retrouvez les réponses aux questions les plus fréquemment posées par les familles.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="faq-item border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden" data-animate data-delay="1">
          <button class="faq-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-6 text-left bg-white hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="font-bold text-[#1a3a6b] text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug" style="font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif">Qui peut bénéficier des services de {{ site.name }} ?</span>
            <span class="faq-chevron flex-shrink-0 text-[#2a9d8f] transition-transform duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer overflow-hidden" style="max-height:0">
            <div class="px-6 pb-6 bg-[#f8faff] border-t border-gray-100">
              <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed pt-4">Nos services s'adressent aux élèves de la primaire au lycée, souhaitant renforcer leurs compétences scolaires, consolider leurs acquis ou préparer leurs examens (Brevet, Baccalauréat). Nous accueillons tous les élèves des Yvelines (78) qui ont besoin d'un accompagnement personnalisé.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden" data-animate data-delay="2">
          <button class="faq-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-6 text-left bg-white hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="font-bold text-[#1a3a6b] text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug" style="font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif">Comment inscrire mon enfant ?</span>
            <span class="faq-chevron flex-shrink-0 text-[#2a9d8f] transition-transform duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer overflow-hidden" style="max-height:0">
            <div class="px-6 pb-6 bg-[#f8faff] border-t border-gray-100">
              <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed pt-4">L'inscription se fait en plusieurs étapes : 1. Contactez-nous par téléphone ou email pour un premier échange. 2. Complétez le formulaire d'inscription. 3. Fournissez les documents requis (bulletins scolaires si disponibles). 4. Réglez la cotisation annuelle et les frais des prestations choisies.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden" data-animate data-delay="3">
          <button class="faq-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-6 text-left bg-white hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="font-bold text-[#1a3a6b] text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug" style="font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif">Combien d'élèves y a-t-il par groupe ?</span>
            <span class="faq-chevron flex-shrink-0 text-[#2a9d8f] transition-transform duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer overflow-hidden" style="max-height:0">
            <div class="px-6 pb-6 bg-[#f8faff] border-t border-gray-100">
              <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed pt-4">Pour garantir un suivi personnalisé, les groupes sont volontairement limités : maximum 6 élèves par groupe en soutien scolaire régulier, et 10 élèves maximum pour deux intervenants lors des stages de vacances. Des séances individuelles sont également possibles selon les besoins.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden" data-animate data-delay="4">
          <button class="faq-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-6 text-left bg-white hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="font-bold text-[#1a3a6b] text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug" style="font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif">Que se passe-t-il en cas d'absence de mon enfant ?</span>
            <span class="faq-chevron flex-shrink-0 text-[#2a9d8f] transition-transform duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer overflow-hidden" style="max-height:0">
            <div class="px-6 pb-6 bg-[#f8faff] border-t border-gray-100">
              <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed pt-4">En cas d'absence prévenue au moins 48 heures à l'avance, nous essaierons de proposer un report ou une solution alternative. En cas d'absence non justifiée ou signalée trop tardivement, aucun remboursement ou report ne sera possible.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden" data-animate data-delay="5">
          <button class="faq-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-6 text-left bg-white hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="font-bold text-[#1a3a6b] text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug" style="font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif">L'adhésion à l'association est-elle obligatoire ?</span>
            <span class="faq-chevron flex-shrink-0 text-[#2a9d8f] transition-transform duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer overflow-hidden" style="max-height:0">
            <div class="px-6 pb-6 bg-[#f8faff] border-t border-gray-100">
              <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed pt-4">Oui, l'adhésion annuelle à l'association est obligatoire pour bénéficier de nos services. Elle permet de soutenir les activités de l'association et de participer à notre mission d'aide à la réussite scolaire.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden" data-animate data-delay="6">
          <button class="faq-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-6 text-left bg-white hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="font-bold text-[#1a3a6b] text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug" style="font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif">Quels sont les moyens de paiement acceptés ?</span>
            <span class="faq-chevron flex-shrink-0 text-[#2a9d8f] transition-transform duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer overflow-hidden" style="max-height:0">
            <div class="px-6 pb-6 bg-[#f8faff] border-t border-gray-100">
              <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed pt-4">Nous acceptons les chèques, les virements bancaires et les espèces (dans nos locaux avec justificatif). Des facilités de paiement peuvent être envisagées selon les situations. N'hésitez pas à nous contacter pour en discuter.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden" data-animate data-delay="7">
          <button class="faq-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-6 text-left bg-white hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="font-bold text-[#1a3a6b] text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug" style="font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif">Dans quelles matières proposez-vous un soutien ?</span>
            <span class="faq-chevron flex-shrink-0 text-[#2a9d8f] transition-transform duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer overflow-hidden" style="max-height:0">
            <div class="px-6 pb-6 bg-[#f8faff] border-t border-gray-100">
              <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed pt-4">Nous proposons un soutien dans toutes les matières scolaires : mathématiques, français, langues vivantes, sciences, histoire-géographie, etc. Notre équipe s'adapte aux besoins spécifiques de chaque élève et à son programme scolaire.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 text-center" data-animate>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">Vous ne trouvez pas la réponse à votre question ?</p>
      <a href="#contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#1a3a6b] hover:bg-[#1e4a8a] text-white font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-sm transition-all duration-200 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5" style="font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif">
        Contactez-nous directement
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ CONTACT ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="contact" class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-[#f8faff]">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl">
    <div class="text-center mb-16" data-animate>
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[#2a9d8f] font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
        <span class="w-8 h-0.5 bg-[#2a9d8f]"></span>Rejoignez-nous<span class="w-8 h-0.5 bg-[#2a9d8f]"></span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-black text-[#1a3a6b] mb-4" style="font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif">Contact &amp; Inscription</h2>
      <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-[#f4a020] rounded-full mx-auto mb-6"></div>
      <p class="text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-base leading-relaxed">
        Prêt à accompagner votre enfant vers la réussite ? Contactez-nous pour un premier échange gratuit et sans engagement.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16">
      <div data-animate="x-left">
        <div class="space-y-4 mb-10">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-5 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#1a3a6b]/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-[#1a3a6b] transition-colors">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-[#1a3a6b] group-hover:text-white transition-colors"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-0.5">Téléphone</div>
                  <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneRaw }}" class="font-semibold text-[#1a3a6b] hover:text-[#2a9d8f] transition-colors">{{ site.phone }}</a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-5 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#1a3a6b]/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-[#1a3a6b] transition-colors">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-[#1a3a6b] group-hover:text-white transition-colors"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-0.5">Email</div>
                  <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" class="font-semibold text-[#1a3a6b] hover:text-[#2a9d8f] transition-colors">{{ site.email }}</a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-5 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#1a3a6b]/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-[#1a3a6b] transition-colors">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-[#1a3a6b] group-hover:text-white transition-colors"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"/><path d="M2 12h20"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-0.5">Site web</div>
                  <a href="https://{{ site.websiteDisplay }}" class="font-semibold text-[#1a3a6b] hover:text-[#2a9d8f] transition-colors">{{ site.websiteDisplay }}</a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-5 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#1a3a6b]/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-[#1a3a6b] transition-colors">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-[#1a3a6b] group-hover:text-white transition-colors"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-0.5">Département</div>
                  <span class="font-semibold text-[#1a3a6b]">{{ site.department }}</span>
                </div>
              </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#1a3a6b] rounded-3xl p-8 text-white">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-black mb-2" style="font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif">Suivez-nous sur les réseaux</h3>
          <p class="text-blue-200 text-sm mb-6">Restez informés des actualités, stages et événements de {{ site.name }}.</p>
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <a href="{{ site.facebook }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/10 hover:bg-[#f4a020] px-5 py-3 rounded-xl transition-colors text-sm font-bold">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 2h-3a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3z"/></svg> Facebook
            </a>
            <a href="{{ site.instagram }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/10 hover:bg-[#f4a020] px-5 py-3 rounded-xl transition-colors text-sm font-bold">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="20" x="2" y="2" rx="5" ry="5"/><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"/><line x1="17.5" x2="17.51" y1="6.5" y2="6.5"/></svg> Instagram
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden h-40">
          <img src="/assets/images/contact-bg.webp" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#2a9d8f]/70 flex items-center justify-center">
            <p class="text-white text-xl font-black text-center px-4" style="font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif">"{{ site.slogan }}"</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div data-animate="x-right">
        <div id="form-success" class="hidden bg-white rounded-3xl p-12 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-[#2a9d8f]/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
            <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none">
              <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="20" fill="#2a9d8f" opacity="0.2"/>
              <path d="M12 20l6 6 10-12" stroke="#2a9d8f" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#1a3a6b] mb-3" style="font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif">Message envoyé !</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">Votre client mail va s'ouvrir. Nous vous répondrons dans les plus brefs délais.</p>
          <button id="form-reset" class="text-[#2a9d8f] font-semibold hover:underline text-sm">Envoyer un autre message</button>
        </div>
        <form id="contact-form" class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-[#1a3a6b] mb-6" style="font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif">Demande d'information / Inscription</h3>
          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4">
            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">Nom complet *</label>
              <input type="text" name="name" required placeholder="Votre nom" class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 focus:border-[#2a9d8f] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#2a9d8f]/20 text-sm transition-colors" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">Téléphone</label>
              <input type="tel" name="phone" placeholder="{{ site.phone }}" class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 focus:border-[#2a9d8f] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#2a9d8f]/20 text-sm transition-colors" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mb-4">
            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">Email *</label>
            <input type="email" name="email" required placeholder="votre@email.com" class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 focus:border-[#2a9d8f] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#2a9d8f]/20 text-sm transition-colors" />
          </div>
          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4">
            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">Niveau scolaire</label>
              <select name="level" class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 focus:border-[#2a9d8f] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#2a9d8f]/20 text-sm transition-colors bg-white">
                <option value="">Sélectionner...</option>
                <option>Primaire (CP-CM2)</option>
                <option>Collège (6ème-3ème)</option>
                <option>Lycée (2nde-Terminale)</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">Service souhaité</label>
              <select name="service" class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 focus:border-[#2a9d8f] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#2a9d8f]/20 text-sm transition-colors bg-white">
                <option value="">Sélectionner...</option>
                {% for svc in site.services %}
                  <option>{{ svc.name }}</option>
                {% endfor %}
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mb-6">
            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">Message</label>
            <textarea name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Décrivez les besoins de votre enfant, ses difficultés, vos disponibilités..." class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 focus:border-[#2a9d8f] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#2a9d8f]/20 text-sm transition-colors resize-none"></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-[#f4a020] hover:bg-[#e8920a] text-white font-bold py-4 rounded-full text-sm transition-all duration-200 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5" style="font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z"/><path d="m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939"/></svg> Envoyer ma demande
          </button>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 text-center mt-4">Réponse garantie sous 48h ouvrées. Premier entretien gratuit et sans engagement.</p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
